### 应用状态（不访问外部模型）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/observability/status

### 同步 ChatClient：会产生 ChatClient、Advisor 和离线 ChatModel observation
POST http://localhost:8080/api/observability/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "请用一句话解释 Spring AI 可观测性"
}

### 流式 ChatClient：观察在 Flux 完成后停止
POST http://localhost:8080/api/observability/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "分两段说明指标与追踪的区别"
}

### SimpleVectorStore：产生 add/query 向量库 observation
POST http://localhost:8080/api/observability/vector/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "如何记录模型指标",
  "topK": 2
}

### 应用当前已注册的 Meter 名称
GET http://localhost:8080/api/observability/metrics

### Spring Boot Actuator 指标
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/metrics

### Prometheus 格式
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus
